  "generated_text": "The distance from the point $(1,2,3)$ to the line is given by the formula:\n\\[d = \\frac{\\left| \\begin{pmatrix} 6 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 7 \\end{pmatrix} - \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\end{pmatrix} \\right|}{\\left| \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\end{pmatrix} \\right|}.\\]\nCalculating the numerator and denominator:\n\\[d = \\frac{\\left| \\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix} \\right|}{\\left| \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\end{pmatrix} \\right|} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5^2 + 5^2 + 4^2}}{\\sqrt{3^2 + 2^2 + (-2)^2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{50}}{\\sqrt{17}} = \\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{17}} = \\boxed{\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{17}}.\\]",
